## Missions (Phase 3)
cl.missao.peneira.titulo=Prospector
cl.missao.peneira.desc=Craft a Sieve (sticks, string and planks) and place it.
cl.missao.garimpo.titulo=Gold in the sand
cl.missao.garimpo.desc=Sift 20 blocks of sand or gravel. Seeds, clay, nuggets and even saplings come out.
cl.missao.argila.titulo=Clay
cl.missao.argila.desc=Collect 8 clay balls from the sieve.
cl.missao.compostor.titulo=Nothing goes to waste
cl.missao.compostor.desc=Craft a Dirt Composter (planks and dirt) and place it.
cl.missao.adubo.titulo=Fresh soil
