## Missions (Phase 7)
cl.missao.mumias.titulo=The dead walk
cl.missao.mumias.desc=Defeat 5 mummies. They come out at night and their touch makes you hungry.
cl.missao.escorpioes.titulo=Venomous sting
cl.missao.escorpioes.desc=Defeat 5 desert scorpions. Watch out for the poison: they climb walls.
cl.missao.golem.titulo=Made of sand
cl.missao.golem.desc=Defeat a Sand Golem. They only appear during sandstorms.
cl.missao.faixas.titulo=Ancient wraps
