cl.catalogo.barril_encontro_lava=Lava barrel with a water block on top.
cl.catalogo.barril_encontro_agua=Water barrel with a lava block on top.
cl.catalogo.barril_slime=Milk in water: in %s s it becomes slime (balls); then a Slime spawns.
