cl.temp.congelamento_n=Frostbite %s
cl.temp.dedos=§bYour numb fingers dropped what you were holding.
cl.temp.dormentes=§bYour fingers are numb with cold. Only a golden apple cures frostbite.
cl.temp.pernas=§bYour legs have stiffened with cold. Only a golden apple cures frostbite.
cl.sede.desidratado=Dehydrated
cl.agua.salgada=§cSalt water: it quenched a bit of thirst, but it will dehydrate you.
cl.camel.cheio=The Camel Pack is already full.
cl.camel.encheu=Camel Pack: %s/%s water.
cl.mascara.sem_mascara=Wear the Gas Mask to change the filter.
cl.mascara.cheia=The mask filter is already full.
